{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50350","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 三、莫高窟咏[二] · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 三、莫高窟咏[二]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪岭干青汉，云楼架碧空，重开千佛刹[一二]，旁出四天宫。\n瑞鸟含珠影，灵花吐蕙藂（丛）。\n洗心游胜境，从此去尘蒙。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}